Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 00:28:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Direct app: verify cart/profile hand-off to delivery
 checkout; plan 2a/2b

Adds a browser check that a cart built in the no-table app and the signed-in profile
arrive in delivery.html. Splits Phase 2 in the plan: 2a (this) needs no rules/bot/billing
change; 2b (pickup, native checkout) lists the decisions it depends on.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Ed5NQtedhQ5SdCJqqDJpCe
